@startuml Knowledge Edit - Data Flow

title Flux de donnees : Mise a jour d'un document avec re-chunking
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

actor "Admin UI\n(KnowledgeBasePage)" as UI
participant "DocumentEditDialog" as DlgEdit
participant "ConfirmReChunkDialog" as DlgConfirm
participant "Next.js API Route\nPATCH [slug]/documents/[docId]" as API
participant "requireAdminApi()" as Auth
participant "Zod Validation" as Zod
participant "getCollection()" as GetCol
participant "updateDocument()" as SvcUpdate
database "PostgreSQL\n(Drizzle Transaction)" as DB
participant "RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\n(@langchain/textsplitters)" as Splitter
participant "OpenAI API\ntext-embedding-3-small" as OpenAI
participant "updateCollectionCounts()" as Counts

== Phase 1 : Ouverture du formulaire d'edition ==

UI -> API : GET /knowledge/{slug}/documents/{docId}
API -> Auth : Verifier session admin
Auth --> API : OK (adminId)
API -> GetCol : getCollection(slug)
GetCol -> DB : SELECT * FROM collection WHERE slug = ?
DB --> GetCol : CollectionRow
GetCol --> API : collection
API -> DB : SELECT * FROM document\nWHERE id = docId AND collection_id = ?
DB --> API : DocumentDetail (avec contentText)
API --> UI : 200 { document: { id, title, contentText, ... } }

UI -> DlgEdit : Afficher le formulaire\npre-rempli (title, content)

== Phase 2 : Modification par l'utilisateur ==

DlgEdit -> DlgEdit : L'utilisateur modifie\nle titre et/ou le contenu

DlgEdit -> DlgEdit : handleSaveDocument()\nDetecte que le contenu est modifie

alt Contenu modifie (content !== originalContent)
    DlgEdit -> DlgConfirm : Afficher la confirmation\n"X chunks seront re-generes"
    DlgConfirm --> DlgEdit : Utilisateur confirme
end

== Phase 3 : Envoi de la requete PATCH ==

DlgEdit -> UI : handleSaveDocument() (confirme)
UI -> API : PATCH /knowledge/{slug}/documents/{docId}\n{ title: "...", content: "..." }

API -> Auth : Verifier session admin
Auth --> API : OK

API -> Zod : Valider le body\nz.object({ title?, content? })
Zod --> API : Donnees validees

API -> GetCol : getCollection(slug)
GetCol --> API : collection (ou 404)

API -> SvcUpdate : updateDocument(docId, collectionId, { title, content })

== Phase 4 : Re-chunking transactionnel ==

SvcUpdate -> SvcUpdate : needsReChunk = true\n(content fourni)

SvcUpdate -> OpenAI : Verifier disponibilite\n(getEmbeddings())
OpenAI --> SvcUpdate : OK (embeddings instance)

group Transaction PostgreSQL [ATOMIQUE]

    SvcUpdate -> DB : DELETE FROM ai_engine_knowledge_chunk\nWHERE document_id = '{docId}'
    DB --> SvcUpdate : N rows deleted

    SvcUpdate -> DB : UPDATE ai_engine_knowledge_document\nSET title = ?, content_text = ?,\nupdated_at = NOW()\nWHERE id = '{docId}'
    DB --> SvcUpdate : 1 row updated

    SvcUpdate -> Splitter : splitText(newContent)\nchunkSize=1000, overlap=200
    Splitter --> SvcUpdate : string[] chunks (ex: 5 chunks)

    loop Pour chaque batch de 100 chunks
        SvcUpdate -> OpenAI : embedDocuments(batch)\n1536 dimensions
        OpenAI --> SvcUpdate : float[][] vectors
        SvcUpdate -> DB : INSERT INTO ai_engine_knowledge_chunk\n(collection_id, document_id,\ncontent, embedding, metadata)\nVALUES (...)
        DB --> SvcUpdate : Chunks inseres
    end

    SvcUpdate -> DB : UPDATE ai_engine_knowledge_document\nSET chunk_count = {totalChunks}\nWHERE id = '{docId}'
    DB --> SvcUpdate : OK

end

note over DB : COMMIT si tout OK\nROLLBACK si erreur

== Phase 5 : Mise a jour des compteurs ==

SvcUpdate -> Counts : updateCollectionCounts(collectionId)
Counts -> DB : SELECT count(*) FROM documents\nWHERE collection_id = ?
DB --> Counts : documentCount
Counts -> DB : SELECT count(*) FROM chunks\nWHERE collection_id = ?
DB --> Counts : chunkCount
Counts -> DB : UPDATE collection\nSET document_count = ?,\nchunk_count = ?,\nlast_indexed_at = NOW()
DB --> Counts : OK
Counts --> SvcUpdate : OK

SvcUpdate --> API : { success: true,\nchunkCount: 5,\nreChunked: true }

== Phase 6 : Reponse a l'UI ==

API --> UI : 200 {\n  success: true,\n  chunkCount: 5,\n  reChunked: true\n}

UI -> DlgEdit : Fermer la modale
UI -> UI : setIngestSuccess("Document mis a jour\navec 5 chunks re-generes")
UI -> API : GET /knowledge (rafraichir la liste)
API --> UI : { collections: [...] }
UI -> API : GET /knowledge/{slug}/documents\n(rafraichir les documents)
API --> UI : { documents: [...] }

== Scenario d'erreur : Echec OpenAI ==

note over OpenAI : Si l'API OpenAI\nechoue pendant\nl'embedding

SvcUpdate -[#red]-> OpenAI : embedDocuments(batch)
OpenAI -[#red]-> SvcUpdate : Error: Rate limit exceeded

note over DB #FFcccc : ROLLBACK automatique\nLes anciens chunks sont preserves

SvcUpdate --> API : { success: false,\nerror: "Rate limit exceeded",\nchunkCount: 0,\nreChunked: false }

API --> UI : 500 {\n  error: "Update failed",\n  detail: "Rate limit exceeded"\n}

UI -> DlgEdit : Afficher l'erreur\ndans la modale\n(formulaire reste ouvert)

@enduml
